ワクワクは 続いてくよ！
The excitement will keep going!

440
00:40:34,104 --> 00:40:34,704
(ゴーー！) (レッツゴー！)
Let's go! Let's go!

441
00:40:35,104 --> 00:40:38,704
初めての扉さぁ、ドンドン開けていこう (ゴーー！)
Opening the first door together with a bang! (Let's go!)

442
00:40:38,754 --> 00:40:39,204
「怖がらず行こ～！」
"Let's go without fear!"

443
00:40:39,504 --> 00:40:41,704
ついつい躓きそう でも一人じゃない…よね？ (ゴーー！)
Fumbling and stumbling around, but we're not alone... right? (Let's go!)

444
00:40:41,804 --> 00:40:42,554
「一人じゃない…よね？」
"You're not alone... right?"

445
00:40:42,704 --> 00:40:44,704
迷ってもいいよ だって寄り道もイベントだし
It's okay to get lost, detours are events too, after all!

446
00:40:44,804 --> 00:40:45,904
前のめり go！
Going forward, go!

447
00:40:45,904 --> 00:40:46,304
(oh yeah！)
(Oh yeah!)

448
00:40:46,404 --> 00:40:47,004
助走つけ go！
Running headfirst, go!

449
00:40:47,004 --> 00:40:47,304
(oh yeah！)
(Oh yeah!)

450
00:40:47,554 --> 00:40:50,704
まだまだ… バカタレレーション！
Not yet... Bakatarention!

451
00:40:50,504 --> 00:40:51,054
(イェーーーーーイー！！！)
(Yeaaaaaah!)

452
00:40:51,154 --> 00:40:52,704
駆け抜けてこい オールウェイズ！ (always！)
Running through it all, always! (Always!)

453
00:40:52,754 --> 00:40:53,704
はしゃぎながら オールデイズ！ (all days！)
Smiling all the way, all days! (All days!)

454
00:41:02,304 --> 00:41:03,004
たーだ！
Ta-da!

455
00:41:03,804 --> 00:41:07,404
ということで、突然で皆さんびっくりしたと思いますけども、
So, everyone might be surprised, but guess what?

456
00:41:07,704 --> 00:41:13,004
なんと、この度バカタレのオリジナル楽曲ができましたー！
This time, Bakatarention got an original song!

457
00:41:12,854 --> 00:41:13,304
わーい！
Yay!

458
00:41:13,554 --> 00:41:15,204
やったー！
Yay! We did it!

459
00:41:15,504 --> 00:41:16,804
ふぶちゃんのお誕生日プレゼントってこと？
Is this Fubuki's birthday present?

460
00:41:17,354 --> 00:41:19,704
えっ、そういうことなの、これって。
Yeah, that's what this is!

461
00:41:19,354 --> 00:41:20,104
そういことさ。
That's right!

462
00:41:20,204 --> 00:41:21,104
そういことだったの！
That's what it was!

463
00:41:21,154 --> 00:41:22,754
いや、誕生日にすまんね。
Man, thank you for the birthday gift!

464
00:41:23,204 --> 00:41:24,704
いやあ、嬉しいよ。
I'm so happy!

465
00:41:25,704 --> 00:41:26,404
でもこっそり準備してたじゃないか、ね？
We secretly prepared it, you know?

466
00:41:27,704 --> 00:41:28,404
一緒にね、みんなでね。
Together, all of us.

467
00:41:29,804 --> 00:41:30,204
まあまあまあまあ！
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!

468
00:41:30,604 --> 00:41:32,704
まあまあまあまあ！
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!

469
00:41:34,104 --> 00:41:37,004
ということで、猫・犬・羊で「進め↑BAKATARATION」というね、はい、オリジナルを、はい作ってみんなで歌っていただきました！
So, as cat-dog-sheep, we made "Susume Bakatarention"!

470
00:41:41,604 --> 00:41:42,404
わーい！
Yay!

471
00:41:42,954 --> 00:41:44,704
みんなバラバラの方向を向いているが！
We were facing all different directions though!

472
00:41:46,454 --> 00:41:47,704
あつい！あつい！
Hot! It's hot!

473
00:41:49,004 --> 00:41:50,204
あつい！バカタレ！
Hot, Bakatarention!

474
00:41:51,754 --> 00:41:53,704
こちらの楽曲ですね、まあMVとかね、まあ発売とかはね、もちろん、もちろん！
As for this original song, like MV and release and stuff...

475
00:41:56,704 --> 00:41:58,204
もちろんあるんですけども、今ね、YAGOOさんたちと相談しながら制作中でございますので！
Well, we're still discussing it with Yagoo,

476
00:42:02,704 --> 00:42:03,204
はい、聞きたい方はぜひともまたこのね、ライブをアーカイブを見直していただいて、
So if you want to hear it more, please rewatch the live archive...

477
00:42:06,804 --> 00:42:09,204
聞いて笑ってね、いつかはライブでやるぞ！
Laugh and smile, and one day sing it at a live concert!

478
00:42:10,254 --> 00:42:11,204
おー！
Ooh!

479
00:42:11,504 --> 00:42:13,504
いつかはね、リアルなバカタレライブでこの歌を歌いたいと思います、また！
Someday we want to sing this song at a real live concert again!

480
00:42:15,104 --> 00:42:16,704
まだまだ、バカタレが話せません！
Still, still, Bakatarention cannot stop talking!

481
00:42:21,154 --> 00:42:23,704
ということで皆さんありがとうございました！バカタレれどんでした！
So everyone, thank you so much, we were Bakatarention!

482
00:42:24,704 --> 00:42:28,204
ありがとうございましたー！
Thank you very much!

483
00:42:37,504 --> 00:42:38,754
この胸に あの日君が蒔いた
That day, you planted in this chest

484
00:42:41,704 --> 00:42:42,204
小さな涙の種
a small seed of tears.

485
00:42:44,204 --> 00:42:48,204
いつか大きな笑顔の花 咲かせるその日まで
Until the day it blooms into a big flower of smiles,

486
00:42:50,704 --> 00:42:53,204
めまぐるしい 毎日の中でも
amidst these dazzling days,

487
00:42:53,204 --> 00:42:54,704
時々不意に巻き戻してる
I sometimes unthinkingly rewind.

488
00:43:12,204 --> 00:43:14,704
めまぐるしい毎日のなかでも時々不意に巻き戻してる
Even in the bustling everyday life, I sometimes unthinkingly rewind to the past.

489
00:43:19,204 --> 00:43:19,704
あの先もずっと君といられたら
If I could always be with you from then on,

490
00:43:24,204 --> 00:43:24,704
もしもの未来
a possible future...

491
00:43:27,554 --> 00:43:28,204
どこにもいない姿を
Even if you're nowhere to be seen,

492
00:43:29,504 --> 00:43:30,704
どこにいても感じたまま
I still feel you wherever I am.

493
00:43:34,704 --> 00:43:35,204
今日も同じ空の下で
Today too, under the same sky,

494
00:43:37,704 --> 00:43:38,204
明日へと向かうよ
I'm heading towards tomorrow.

495
00:43:43,204 --> 00:43:46,704
繰り返す言葉はまるで心を溶かすように
These repeating words feel as though they are melting my heart,

496
00:43:50,704 --> 00:43:51,704
僕に今語りかけるんだ
speaking to me now

497
00:43:56,704 --> 00:43:58,704
愛しいその声で
with that beloved voice.

498
00:44:00,204 --> 00:44:02,704
この胸に あの日君が蒔いた
That day, you planted in this chest

499
00:44:04,704 --> 00:44:06,704
小さな涙の種
a small seed of tears.

500
00:44:09,204 --> 00:44:13,704
いつか大きな笑顔の花 咲かせるその日まで
Until the day it blooms into a big flower of smiles,

501
00:44:16,204 --> 00:44:16,704
ここにいるから
I'll be right here.

502
00:44:29,204 --> 00:44:30,704
たぶん特別なことではなくて
It's not about anything particularly special,

503
00:44:32,704 --> 00:44:36,204
やがて誰もがその意味を知る
soon everyone will know what it means.

504
00:44:36,704 --> 00:44:38,704
赤く燃え尽きる雲の切れ間には
Through a break in the burning crimson clouds,

505
00:44:39,204 --> 00:44:40,704
星が瞬く
stars are twinkling.

506
00:44:42,704 --> 00:44:44,204
その瞳は今どこで
Where are your eyes now,

507
00:44:45,704 --> 00:44:46,704
どんな景色を見ているの？
and what kind of scenery are they seeing?

508
00:44:50,704 --> 00:44:51,204
君が好きだった季節が また巡ってくるよ
The season that you loved is rolling around again.

509
00:44:54,704 --> 00:44:56,704
抱きしめた君の欠片たちは 何も変わらないまま
The fragments of you that I hold close haven't changed at all.

510
00:45:01,062 --> 00:45:04,702
抱きしめた 君の欠片たちは
The fragments of you that I held close

511
00:45:04,702 --> 00:45:08,402
何も変わらないまま
remain completely unchanged,

512
00:45:08,502 --> 00:45:12,402
何度でも語りかけるんだ
and I'll talk to them over and over again

513
00:45:12,402 --> 00:45:16,102
愛しいその声で
with that beloved voice of yours.

514
00:45:16,502 --> 00:45:22,602
忘れない あの日君が蒔いた 小さな涙の種
I won't forget that small seed of tears you sowed that day—

515
00:45:22,902 --> 00:45:32,102
いつか大きな笑顔の花 咲かせるその日まで
until the day it blooms into a great flower of smiles.

516
00:45:32,102 --> 00:45:35,902
ここにいるから
Because I'm right here.

517
00:45:57,902 --> 00:46:04,802
朝も昼も夜も 見つけながら 迷いながら
Morning, noon, and night, searching and hesitating,

518
00:46:04,802 --> 00:46:11,902
僕らは約束の場所へ急ぐ
we hurry to our promised place.

519
00:46:12,202 --> 00:46:15,602
繰り返す言葉は
The repeating words

520
00:46:15,602 --> 00:46:23,102
すっかり心をとかすように 僕に今語りかけるんだ
speak to me now as if melting my heart,

521
00:46:23,102 --> 00:46:30,502
愛しいその声で
with that beloved voice of yours.

522
00:46:30,802 --> 00:46:38,902
この胸に あの日君が蒔いた 小さな涙の種
That small seed of tears you sowed in this chest of mine that day—

523
00:46:38,902 --> 00:46:46,102
やっと大きな笑顔の花 咲かせたんだ
finally bloomed into a great flower of smiles.

524
00:46:46,102 --> 00:46:49,902
きっといつまでも
I'm sure, forever and ever,

525
00:46:49,902 --> 00:46:54,302
ここにいるから
because I'm right here.

526
00:47:52,202 --> 00:47:57,802
逃げたり諦めることは 誰でも
Anyone can run away or give up in an instant,

527
00:47:57,802 --> 00:48:04,802
一瞬あればできるから 歩き続けよう
so just keep on walking!

528
00:48:04,802 --> 00:48:10,602
君にしかできないことがある
There is something only you can do.

529
00:48:10,702 --> 00:48:18,002
青い星に 光が失せぬように
So that this blue star doesn't lose its light,

530
00:48:19,402 --> 00:48:22,702
つかめ! 描いた夢を
Seize the dream you drew!

531
00:48:22,702 --> 00:48:27,202
まもれ! 大事な友を
Protect your precious friends!

532
00:48:27,202 --> 00:48:33,402
たくましい自分になれるさ
You can become a stronger self!

533
00:48:33,402 --> 00:48:40,602
知らないパワーが宿る ハートに火がついたら
When an unknown power dwells and your heart catches fire,

534
00:48:40,602 --> 00:48:46,902
どんな願いも嘘じゃない きっとかなうから
any wish isn't a lie, it will surely come true...

535
00:48:48,002 --> 00:48:50,502
show me your brave heart

536
00:49:10,202 --> 00:49:16,202
晴れの日ばかりじゃないから たまには冷たい雨も降るけれど
It's not always sunny days, so sometimes cold rain falls too,

537
00:49:16,202 --> 00:49:22,502
傘ひろげよう 生き方に地図なんかないけれど
but let's open our umbrellas—there's no map for how to live,

538
00:49:22,502 --> 00:49:30,102
だから自由 どこへだって行ける、君も
that's why we're free, you can go anywhere too.

539
00:49:30,102 --> 00:49:36,102
はしれ! 風より速く メザせ! 空より遠く
Run faster than the wind! Aim farther than the sky!

540
00:49:36,102 --> 00:49:42,002
新しい自分に逢えるさ
You can meet a new self!

541
00:49:42,002 --> 00:49:49,502
知らない勇気が眠る ハートに気がついたら
When you realize the unknown courage sleeping in your heart,

542
00:49:49,502 --> 00:49:57,202
胸の中のどしゃ降りも きっと止むから
the downpour in your chest will surely stop...

543
00:49:58,002 --> 00:50:03,652
show me your brave heart

544
00:50:04,820 --> 00:50:06,680
逃げたりあきらめるコトは 誰も
If anyone can give up and run

545
00:50:06,780 --> 00:50:09,290
一瞬あればできるから 歩き続けよう
for even a second, just keep on walking.

546
00:50:26,267 --> 00:50:29,097
君にしかできないことがある
There's something only you can do,

547
00:50:29,097 --> 00:50:31,717
青い星に
so that this blue planet

548
00:50:31,717 --> 00:50:33,667
光が失わぬように
doesn't lose its light.

549
00:50:33,667 --> 00:50:35,667
つかめる！描いた夢を
Seize the dreams you drew!

550
00:50:35,667 --> 00:50:38,317
まもれる！大事な友を
Protect your precious friends!

551
00:50:38,317 --> 00:50:41,217
たくましい自分になれるさ
You can become stronger.

552
00:50:41,217 --> 00:50:46,167
知らないパワーが宿る ハートに火がついたら
Unknown power dwells in your heart, when its fire is lit.

553
00:50:46,167 --> 00:50:48,367
どんな願いも 嘘 じゃない
Any wish, it's not a lie,

554
00:50:48,367 --> 00:50:51,967
きっと 叶う から
it will surely be granted.

555
00:50:51,967 --> 00:50:55,667
show me your brave heart

556
00:51:07,767 --> 00:51:10,667
皆さん、今日はありがとうね！
Everyone, thank you so much today!

557
00:51:10,667 --> 00:51:13,167
ありがとうだよー！
Thank you so much!

558
00:51:31,587 --> 00:51:37,887
はい、ということで2曲続けて聴いていただきました。本日はありがとうございましたー！
So, you've listened to two songs in a row. Thank you very much today!

559
00:51:38,787 --> 00:51:51,387
涙のね、笑顔の花はですね、一昨年のライブの時は青空デイズを歌っていただいたんですけども
For "Namida no Tegami" / "Egao no Hana", during the 1st-gen live we had "Aozora Days" sung,

560
00:51:51,387 --> 00:52:06,187
今回はブレイブハートということで皆さん進化しましたか？大丈夫ですか？
but this time it's "brave heart"—everyone, have you evolved? Are you alright?

561
00:52:06,987 --> 00:52:12,187
では次で最後の曲なんですけども、ここでお知らせです！
Now, for the final song, and here is an announcement!

562
00:52:12,487 --> 00:52:25,987
なんとなんと只今開催中の富士急ハイランドさんにて、10月5日今日から10日までの期間限定で白上の限定ボイスが聴けちゃいます！
Starting today, October 5th until the 10th at Fuji-Q Highland, you can listen to Shirakami's limited voice lines!

563
00:52:25,987 --> 00:52:34,887
そしてなんとメリーゴーランドも白上のテーマファンファーレが流れちゃいますのでぜひ皆さん聴いてくださいおねがいします！
And what's more, Shirakami's theme fanfare will be playing on the merry-go-round too, so please go listen to it!

564
00:52:35,187 --> 00:52:58,787
そしてもう1個なんとなんと明日！明日はですね白上のお誕生日コラボということでライブ2Dの...
And another thing—tomorrow! Tomorrow is Shirakami's birthday collaboration, so Live2D...

565
00:53:13,817 --> 00:53:16,517
皆さん、最後の曲「Say! ファンファーレ！」行きますよー！
Everyone, for our final song, "Say! Fanfare!", let's go!

566
00:53:17,517 --> 00:53:22,217
おっと！せーの！いぇーい！
Ready, set, yay!

567
00:53:22,217 --> 00:53:26,667
はい！はい！おっ！ここ！うーーっ！
Hai! Hai! Woo! Here! Woo!

568
00:53:26,667 --> 00:53:29,667
せーの！ are you ready!?
Ready? Are you ready?!

569
00:53:30,467 --> 00:53:34,167
ほーっとひと息 お茶ですよ
Take a breath, it's tea time.

570
00:53:34,167 --> 00:53:38,667
いつもの場所から 元気にせーのでご挨拶
Greeting you cheerfully from our usual place!

571
00:53:38,667 --> 00:53:41,167
おっこんこんでーまーすーっ!
Hello-con-con-everyone!

572
00:53:41,167 --> 00:53:42,167
始めましょう!
Let's begin!

573
00:53:42,167 --> 00:53:47,167
おしゃべりをして ゲームと過ごす そんな毎日が 愛しくて
Chatting and playing games, loving every single day.

574
00:53:47,467 --> 00:53:52,667
あれもこれも 手を出したくなりがちです
I tend to want to try everything out.

575
00:53:53,167 --> 00:54:00,167
歌とかステージは まだまだ恥ずかしい けど
Singing and stages are still a bit embarrassing, but

576
00:54:00,167 --> 00:54:04,167
支え合って ほら 届けますよ この声を
Supporting each other, I'll deliver this voice to you!

577
00:54:04,467 --> 00:54:06,667
say!

578
00:54:06,667 --> 00:54:11,667
ほらその顔上げて みんなで手を取れば
Raise your face and take each other's hands,

579
00:54:11,667 --> 00:54:17,167
まだまだ道の途中 世界を超えよう
we're still on the way, let's cross the world!

580
00:54:17,167 --> 00:54:21,467
ほらお仕事も 止まらない全力ですから!
Because our push-work never stops, giving it our all!

581
00:54:23,667 --> 00:54:31,167
夢を書きかえてら 追いかけ続けよう ともに 繋ぐ ファンファーレ
Rewrite our dreams and keep chasing them, a fanfare connecting us together!

582
00:55:03,622 --> 00:55:05,472
ほーっとひと息 お茶ですよ
Take a deep breath and have some tea!

583
00:55:04,522 --> 00:55:06,572
黒い あのコには内緒にして欲しいです
Keep it a secret from that black one!

584
00:55:07,022 --> 00:55:12,122
仲間のお力と お友達のみなさんと
With the strength of comrades and all of our friends,

585
00:55:12,472 --> 00:55:18,472
叶えたい想いは 言葉にして 一つ一つ
turn every cherished wish into words, one by one!

586
00:55:19,422 --> 00:55:21,272
Say! ほらその手を上げて
Say! Raise your hands up high,

587
00:55:21,272 --> 00:55:25,022
みんなで輪になれ ば
and let's all form a circle together!

588
00:55:25,422 --> 00:55:29,422
Dive! まだまだ成長途中 世界を越えよう
Dive! We're still growing, let's cross the world!

589
00:55:30,122 --> 00:55:33,872
Say! ほら 明るく元気な 心が取り柄ですから
Say! Let's keep that bright and cheerful spirit!

590
00:55:36,522 --> 00:55:40,372
へこみがちな時も 輝き続けよう
Even on down days, let's keep shining on,

591
00:55:40,972 --> 00:55:44,922
共に繋ぐ アンコール!
connecting together in an encore!

592
00:55:53,772 --> 00:55:56,072
Say! ほらその手を上げて
Say! Raise your hands up high,

593
00:55:56,072 --> 00:55:58,822
みんなで手を取れば
and let's all take each other's hands!

594
00:55:58,822 --> 00:56:01,822
Dive! これから夢の先へ
Dive! Head toward the end of our dreams!

595
00:56:03,622 --> 00:56:05,722
Say! ほら 推しお仕事も 止まらない全力ですから!
Say! Oshi work is a non-stop, all-out effort!

596
00:56:06,522 --> 00:56:08,722
何もかもが新しくって
When everything feels brand new,

597
00:56:08,722 --> 00:56:12,772
右も左もわからない時も
and you don't know left from right,

598
00:56:12,772 --> 00:56:17,872
頑張れたのは 一人じゃないからね
remember you weren't the only one trying hard.

599
00:56:17,872 --> 00:56:20,972
一つ一つ応援が 後押しになって
Every single piece of support pushes me forward,

600
00:56:20,972 --> 00:56:24,872
一歩ずつでも 私は自分らしく 磨いていくfuture
so I'll forge my own future, step by step!

601
00:56:24,872 --> 00:56:29,372
答えも イメージも まだまだ手探りしても
Even as answers and images are still hard to find,

602
00:56:29,372 --> 00:56:32,072
響き合って ほら 世界は今 色めいて
listen, the world is now coming alive in color!

603
00:56:33,022 --> 00:56:34,622
Say! さあその顔上げて
Say! Raise your hands up high,

604
00:56:34,622 --> 00:56:38,122
みんなで手を取れば
and let's all take each other's hands!

605
00:56:38,122 --> 00:56:42,722
Dive! これから夢の先へ
Dive! Head toward the end of our dreams!

606
00:56:43,622 --> 00:56:45,722
Say! ほら 推しお仕事も 止まらない全力ですから!
Say! Oshi work is a non-stop, all-out effort!

607
00:56:49,622 --> 00:56:51,622
何もかもが新しくって
When everything feels brand new,

608
00:56:51,622 --> 00:56:55,622
右も左もわからない時も
and you don't know left from right,

609
00:56:55,622 --> 00:57:00,622
頑張れたのは 一人じゃないからね
remember you weren't the only one trying hard.

610
00:57:00,622 --> 00:57:03,622
一つ一つ応援が 後押しになって
Every single piece of support pushes me forward,

611
00:57:03,622 --> 00:57:09,122
一歩ずつでも 私は自分らしく 磨いていくfuture
so I'll forge my own future, step by step!

612
00:57:09,122 --> 00:57:12,122
皆さん今日は 本当にありがとうございました!
Thank you all so much for today!

613
00:57:14,122 --> 00:57:18,122
みんな お気に入りだよ!
Everyone loves you so much!

